    <entry>
      <title>vmware-harbor</title>
      <link href="/2019/11/28/vmware-harbor/"/>
      <url>/2019/11/28/vmware-harbor/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="/2019/11/28/vmware-harbor/harbor_logo.png" class=""> <h2 id="自建Docker-Image倉庫-VMware-Harbor"><a href="#自建Docker-Image倉庫-VMware-Harbor" class="headerlink" title="自建Docker Image倉庫 - VMware Harbor"></a>自建Docker Image倉庫 - VMware Harbor</h2><h3 id="安裝前必備"><a href="#安裝前必備" class="headerlink" title="安裝前必備"></a>安裝前必備</h3><ol><li>CentOS 7、docker、 <a href="https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">docker-compose</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/vmware/harbor/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download</a> Harbor Installer</li></ol><h3 id="設定檔"><a href="#設定檔" class="headerlink" title="設定檔"></a>設定檔</h3><p>修改harbor.cfg，推薦修改的項目有：hostname、db_password、harbor_admin_password 、clair_db_password</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ vi harbor/harbor.cfg</span></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="安裝並啟動Harbor"><a href="#安裝並啟動Harbor" class="headerlink" title="安裝並啟動Harbor"></a>安裝並啟動Harbor</h3><p>預設儲存位置為  /data</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ ./installer.sh --with-clair</span></pre></td></tr></table></figure><img src="/2019/11/28/vmware-harbor/harbor-1.png" class=""> <h3 id="其他維運問題"><a href="#其他維運問題" class="headerlink" title="其他維運問題"></a>其他維運問題</h3><p>備份 Clair DB</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ docker <span class="built_in">exec</span> clair-db /bin/bash -c  <span class="string">"pg_dump -U postgres -a -t feature \-t keyvalue -t namespace -t schema_migrations -t vulnerability \</span></span></pre></td></tr><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">2</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="string">-t vulnerability_fixedin_feature"</span> &gt; vulnerability.sql$ docker <span class="built_in">exec</span> clair-db /bin/bash -c <span class="string">"pg_dump -U postgres -c -s"</span> &gt; clear.sql</span></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>還原 Clair DB</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ docker <span class="built_in">exec</span> -i clair-db psql -U postgres &lt; clear.sql</span></pre></td></tr><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">2</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ docker <span class="built_in">exec</span> -i clair-db psql -U postgres &lt; vulnerability.sql</span></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>刪除Image後容量卻沒有下降</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ <span class="built_in">cd</span>  <span class="variable">$HARBOR_DIR</span></span></pre></td></tr><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">2</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ docker-compose stop</span></pre></td></tr><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">3</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ docker run -it --name gc --rm --volumes-from registry vmware/registry:2.6.2-photon garbage-collect  /etc/registry/config.yml</span></pre></td></tr><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">4</span></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ docker-compose start</span></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Docker Image複寫</p><img src="/2019/11/28/vmware-harbor/harbor-2.png" class=""> <p>more info: <a href="https://github.com/goharbor/harbor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Harbor</a></p>]]></content>
      
      
      
